# pg_regress schedule format: `test: NAME [NAME...]` runs the named tests in
# order. The harness pins --max-connections=1 so ordering is deterministic and
# the `regression` database persists across tests within a run (so fixtures
# seeded by `test_setup` are visible to every test after it).
#
# INVARIANT: this schedule is the GREEN baseline -- every line is either PASS or
# an intentional, documented KNOWN-DIFF, so `run.sh` exits 0. It grows as later
# steps translate the modules each blocked test needs. Do NOT force a test green
# by editing upstream expected output.
